@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam conditionStyle insideDiamond
scale 5 as 70 pixels
robust "Кнопка вызова" as Button
robust "Лифт" as Lift
robust "Двери" as Doors
@0
Button is Нажата
Lift is Движение
Doors is Закрыты
Button -> Lift : вызов
@1
Button is Отпущена
@25
Lift is НаЭтаже
Doors is Открыты
@31
Doors is Закрыты
@0 <-> @25 : {tOpen - tCall <= 30 с}
@25 <-> @31 : {tClose - tOpen >= 5 с}
@enduml
